# The headers and libraries `xwin splat` lays out from the files of
# microsoft-sdk.sha256, as one hash: the sha256 of every file sorted by
# path, then every symbolic link with its target, then every directory.
# sdk_tree_hash in reproducible/targets/windows.sh computes it. The
# build checks it again before it compiles anything.
